{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q32", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的婚姻状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "通过八字分析，命主日主丁火，生于酉月，财星当令，木火为用。女命以正官为夫星，原局官星壬水藏于年支申中而不透，且被重重酉金围克，夫星衰弱，根基不稳。日支夫妻宫为酉金，月日支酉酉自刑，时支巳火劫财暗合酉金，有争夺之象，婚姻先天不顺。24-33岁大运壬午，正官透出合身，午火为禄，有结婚之象，但午酉相破，婚姻已带裂痕。34-43岁大运辛巳，劫财巳火现于运支，与原局时支巳火一同争合夫妻宫酉金，代表感情易受外界干扰，婚姻名存实亡，离婚可能性极高。\n\n子女方面，女命以食伤为子女，食神戊土藏于时支巳中，子女宫食神主女儿；壬午大运中，午火藏己土伤官主儿子，结合适孕年龄，较可能育有一子一女。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19800921_P007-Q32", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 50292, "response_id": "eac5194d-d3c8-4686-b1d2-180f61a57ea7", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 3059, "total_tokens": 3278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2810}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}}
